          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Turn it on in order</strong> — wall outlet, power switch on the base,
            safety key — and <strong class="text-white">reset it with a proper power cycle</strong>:
            off, unplugged, a minute, back on. Dead? Check the reset button by the switch, then
            <a href="/treadmill-wont-turn-on/" class="text-[#5AA9FF] font-bold no-underline">the usual suspects</a>.
